                        .english: "Husada Hospital, about 5 minutes from here.",
                        .japanese: "フサダ病院です、ここから5分ほどです。",
                        .chinese: "胡萨达医院，离这里大约5分钟。",
                        .spanish: "Hospital Husada, como 5 minutos de aquí."
